# Google Calendar (Plan › Work & calendar): reads shifts in, and can write the plan out to a
# calendar of its own. Optional: without it, import .ics files instead.
# Google Cloud console → APIs & Services: enable the Google Calendar API, then create an
# OAuth client ID of type "Web application" with this site's origin (e.g. http://localhost:5173)
# as an authorised JavaScript origin. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the ID.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Strava import (Settings › Connections). Create an app at https://www.strava.com/settings/api
# with "Authorization Callback Domain" set to this site's host (localhost for local use).
# These are read by the dev/preview server only: the secret never reaches the browser.
STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=
STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=
